## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s Qwen 3.8 is described in local metadata as a dense open-weights model (Apache 2.0) for self-hosted and API agentic/coding workloads with extended context options.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba/Qwen ecosystem (Model Studio/API and open weights per local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen-3.8`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.8` (as referenced in local metadata).
- **Context window:** 262K native (1M via YaRN; 33K output) per local metadata.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** ~$0.42 / $3.00 per 1M in/out (API), $0 self-host (Apache 2.0 open weights) per local metadata; not independently verified from accessible official pricing pages in this pass.
- **Architecture:** Dense open-weights model (27B noted in local description context) per local metadata; not independently verified from accessible official sources in this pass.

